<!-- ══════════════ HOW IT WORKS ══════════════ -->
<div id="how">
    <p><span>HOW IT WORKS</span></p><h2>Three steps to a second you.</h2>
    <div>
      <div>
        <p><span>1</span></p><h3>Install your harness</h3>
        <p>One download. It wraps the agent CLI you already use and runs on
        <b>your</b> laptop. Your code, your keys, your existing subscription —
        nothing leaves your machine.</p>
        <p><img src="https://munderdiffl.in/screenshots/add-agent.png" width="1872" height="1012" loading="lazy" alt="Add Agent dialog: naming your clone and picking its pixel avatar and color from the cast">
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><span>2</span></p><h3>It becomes you</h3>
        <p>It captures your workflow, your tooling and what you know. Every clone
        you run shares that memory, so the next one you spin up starts already
        knowing how you work.</p>
